    - target: {fileID: 7222691419828877991, guid: cdf805fec9c199045ba01bc8b49027ed, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Thank you for your hard work. My friend over on Oberon Reanimation
        got a concerning scroll the other day, blackmailing her about her dark secrets.
        Luckily, all her dark secrets are already out in the open, so it must be
        a scam, haha! If I had gotten such a scroll I would have sent them all my
        gold\u2026\r\n\r\nKeep your eyes peeled!\n\r\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
